<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia raises 30.1 mln dinars in negot bond issue.</title>
<headline>Tunisia raises 30.1 mln dinars in negot bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Monday said it raised 30.1 million dinars from June's issue of treasury bonds negotiable at the bourse (BTNB).</p>
<p>Following is the breakdown of the issue's results (amounts in million dinars, coupon rates in pct):</p>
<p>			 June/amount  June/rate  May/amount May/rate</p>
<p>-Five-year/equal</p>
<p> annual tranches    5.0	    7.9000	 0.2	7.9000</p>
<p>			  5.0	    8.000	 13.5	8.0000</p>
<p>			  3.8	    8.1000	 5	  8.1000</p>
<p>-Ten-year/equal</p>
<p> annual tranches    2.5	    8.5000	  3	 8.5000</p>
<p>			  2.5	    8.6500	 0.5	8.6500</p>
<p>			 11.3	    8.7500	 9	  8.7500</p>
<p>Bids for May's issue amounted to 60.85 million dinars at between 7.9000 and 10.000 percent.</p>
<p>BTNB are issued each month on the first Tuesday. ($=1.1 dinar)</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
